            <h3>Route on confidence</h3>
            <p>
              Do not branch on <code>decision</code> alone. The quality signal is
              <code>confident</code>, which requires both a decisive margin and a passing
              answer-mass gate.
            </p>

            <CodeBlock code={snippets.routeOnConfidence} lang="ts" />

            <h3>Use the environment</h3>
            <p>
              <code>Xonus.fromEnv()</code> resolves
              <code>XONUS_API_KEY</code>, <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code>, or
              <code>GOOGLE_API_KEY</code>, in that order. Any config option can be
